WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.400
Hey coaches, I'm Ava.

00:00:02.400 --> 00:00:03.900
And I'm Andrew.

00:00:03.900 --> 00:00:07.400
We're AI voices, and we're excited
to show you Valencia Solution.

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:10.600
Ten sports. One sideline app.

00:00:10.600 --> 00:00:11.600
Let's go!

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:14.300
Basketball. Scan jerseys with your camera,

00:00:14.300 --> 00:00:16.800
then tap the court for your shot chart.

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.900
Volleyball. Scan jerseys, run your rotations,

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:22.400
and chart every attack and serve.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:25.600
Football. Scan jerseys, animate every route,

00:00:25.600 --> 00:00:27.900
and run a live scoreboard.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.400
Lacrosse. Scan jerseys, draw your dodges,

00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:34.000
then hit play and watch it run.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.300
Hockey. Scan jerseys, draw the play,

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.400
then run bench cards, lines and pairs.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:44.200
Soccer. Scan jerseys. Place your eleven,

00:00:44.200 --> 00:00:46.600
draw the runs, and own your depth chart.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:51.600
Rugby. Your fifteen, lineouts and set pieces,
all in one place.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:57.000
Baseball. A to-scale diamond, pitch counts
and a live batting line.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:01:02.600
Cricket. Set your field, plan the bowler's line,
and keep a live scorecard.

00:01:02.600 --> 00:01:05.400
Curling. Draw curl paths

00:01:05.400 --> 00:01:09.900
and track the linescore, hammer
and shot percentage.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:11.800
Two-phone Live Game.

00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:15.600
Share a five-letter code, and you
and your assistant score together.

00:01:15.600 --> 00:01:18.300
One up. No subscription.

00:01:18.300 --> 00:01:21.600
Claim your free Notepad
at valenciasolution.net.

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:24.600
First thousand coaches, until December 31st.

00:01:24.600 --> 00:01:26.500
You've got this, coach.

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:29.800
See you on the sideline.
